window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>I’ve handled liars, killers, and crooks–but nothing like her.</i></b><br> Money is my mistress. Fixing high-stakes messes, my trade.<br> Until the tables turn and I’m the one with a mess. This time, I haven’t got a plan.Just a gut feeling someone wants me dead.<br> Before I can hit the road, I’m blindsided by a pain-in-the-a-- stranger. Maggie.<br> Curves, startling blue eyes, and an immediate hatred…for me.<br> Our run-in looks to be an innocent mix-up.<br> But my instincts say otherwise. So I flip the script. Her secret becomes my leverage–my ticket out. <br> Then I kiss her. Touch her. Crave her.<br> Maggie was supposed to be a pawn. Instead she becomes my downfall.<br> <b>Dive into a world where trust is dangerous and falling in love could be fatal!</b></p>"; 
